# Unreal build output
**/Build/

# Keep PakBlacklist files
!**/Build/*/
**/Build/*/**
!**/Build/*/PakBlacklist*.txt

# Keep icon files in Build
!**/Build/**/*.ico

# Built data for maps
*_BuiltData.uasset

# Unreal generated editor config
**/Saved/

# Unreal generated build files
**/Intermediate/
**/Plugins/*/Intermediate/

# Unreal cache
**/DerivedDataCache/

# IDEs
.idea/
**/.vs/

# Plugins / tools generated files
**/Plugins/Developer/
**/Builds/

# SteamVR generated config
**/Config/steamvr_ue_editor_app.json
**/Config/SteamVRBindings/

# HoloLens generated config
**/Platforms/HoloLens/Config/HoloLensEngine.ini

# VS Code config
**/.vsconfig